    "updated_at": "2015-05-23T18:38:03Z",
    "body": "Actually neither Attr.nodeValue nor Attr.textContent are nullable, but Node.nodeValue and Node.textContent are. If the Attr ones are made nullable again, it would have to be defined what getAttribute() returns after setting them to null.\n",
